      /* Name                   */      CLPCke_p_KisspointAdaptionTolerance 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "Adaptionfill, this sets the tolerance for finding kiss-point, when the actual pressure increases above the expected linear pressure buildup by this amount it's assumed that the pressure increase is due to being at kisspoint"
      /* Type                   */      VALUE 
      /* ECU Address            */      0x0000 /* @ECU_Address@CLPCke_p_KisspointAdaptionTolerance@ */ 
      /* Record Layout          */      Scalar_SWORD 
