      /* Long Identifier        */      "This is a delay for disabling the fill-compensation due to the difference for fill target
      Set to desired delay, in counts of 5ms sample time
      
      Difference is calibrated with CLPCke_p_MinDiff_FillPartCompensation
      "
      /* Type                   */      VALUE 
