    /begin CHARACTERISTIC 
      /* Name                   */      CLPCie_p_CAPM_TargetPressure 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "### Description
      This is the target pressure for CAPM pressure controller when using manual override
      ### Usage
      Set to target pressure for CAPM pressure controller
      ### Calibration Note
      This value will only be acknowledged when CAPM pressure control is enabled and CAPM pressure test-sequence is not enabled
      "
