    /begin CHARACTERISTIC 
      /* Name                   */      CLPCke_p_PressureKneePointAdaptionMargin 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "### Description
      This is the minimum margin needed for triggering adaption of pressure kneepoint (difference between last kneepoint and actual pressure), if the difference is less than this the adaption of pressure kneepoint won't be activated
      ### Usage
      Set to desired minimum margin for triggering adaption of pressure knee-point
      ### Calibration Note
      "
