    /begin CHARACTERISTIC 
      /* Name                   */      CLPCke_U_CAPM_NominalVoltage 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "### Description
      This is the nominal voltage for CAPM BLDC
      ### Usage
      Set to estimated voltage for CAPM BLDC
      ### Calibration Note
      Untestet!
      This is used for the CAPM speed control, to feed-forward the estimated power needed to maintain target speed
      To calculate the feed-forward DC, the CAPM BLDC voltage is used to estimate the nominal max power"
