      /* Name                   */      CLPCke_Pct_CAPM_RateLimitDecrease 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "### Description
      This is the Decrease rate-limit for output duty-cycle for CAPM BLDC
      ### Usage
      Set to desired DC rate-limitation in Pct duty-cycle Decrease per sample (running at 2.5ms)
      ### Calibration Note
      Set as fast as possible, since speed controller doesn't expect/considers this rate limitation
      Negative Value!
      "
