      /* Long Identifier        */      "### Description
      This ratio of feed-forward to use of estimated power to maintain target CAPM speed
      ### Usage
      Set to estimated ratio, typically 0-1 for how much power based feed-forward to use
      ### Calibration Note
      Untestet!
      "
      /* Type                   */      VALUE 
      /* ECU Address            */      0x0000 /* @ECU_Address@CLPCke_r_CAPM_SpeedControl_PowerBasedFeedForward@ */ 
