    /begin CHARACTERISTIC 
      /* Name                   */      CLPCke_r_StaticToKineticFrictionRatio 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "The ratio between clutch static friction and kinetic friction (us/uk). Since static friction is normally larger than its kinetic counterpart, this cal should exceed 1."
      /* Type                   */      VALUE 
