    /begin CHARACTERISTIC 
      /* Name                   */      CLPCke_Cnt_CAPM_PressureTestSequenceNumberOfPhases 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "### Description
      This is the desired amount of phases to use for target pressure sequence generator for Clutch Actuator Pump Motor
      ### Usage
