    /begin CHARACTERISTIC 
      /* Name                   */      CLPCke_b_CAPM_ChangeBLDC_Direction 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "### Description
      This enables changes which direction of CAPM BLDC is used to build up clutch pressure (by changing sign on the pressure-controller speed target)
      ### Usage
      Set to true if CAPM BLDC direction shall be changed
      ### Calibration Note
      "
