    /begin CHARACTERISTIC 
      /* Name                   */      CLPCke_b_CAPM_SpeedTestSequenceEnable 
      /* Long Identifier        */      "### Description
      This enables the target speed test sequence generator for Clutch Actuator Pump Motor
      ### Usage
      Set to TRUE to enable the sequence generator
      ### Calibration Note
      This only enables the generator, not that the output is used, the sequence generator output is CLPCve_n_CAPM_SpeedTestSequenceTarget
      "
      /* Type                   */      VALUE 
      /* ECU Address            */      0x0000 /* @ECU_Address@CLPCke_b_CAPM_SpeedTestSequenceEnable@ */ 
      /* Record Layout          */      Scalar_BOOLEAN 
      /* Maximum Difference     */      0 
      /* Conversion Method      */      CM_T_BOOLEAN 
