      ### Calibration Note
      Seems as maximum duty-cycle supprted by BLDC is 97.4
      "
      /* Type                   */      VALUE 
      /* ECU Address            */      0x0000 /* @ECU_Address@TCFCke_Pct_CCPM_SpeedControl_DC_Max@ */ 
      /* Record Layout          */      Scalar_SWORD 
      /* Maximum Difference     */      0 
      /* Conversion Method      */      CM_T_Pct_pct_10_1_s16 
      /* Lower Limit            */      0.0 
      /* Upper Limit            */      100.0
